3 0 obj
<< /Length 712 >>
stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 16 TL
(offload. That takes anywhere from fifteen to forty minutes. Then I re-plan.) Tj T*
([21:50] Priya Nair: Ramp loads the aircraft, forty minutes or so, and sends back) Tj T*
(the loading report. It's still on paper and I re-key it. We sometimes wait) Tj T*
(fifteen minutes for it, and at peak we're short of containers.) Tj T*
([27:15] Priya Nair: If the weight deviation is outside tolerance, it's the) Tj T*
(captain who decides, not us. The tolerance depends on the airline contract.) Tj T*
([29:02] Priya Nair: The captain either accepts or asks for a re-trim. Five to) Tj T*
(fifteen minutes.) Tj T*
([31:10] Priya Nair: Then I issue the final load sheet, around T-15.) Tj T*
ET
